      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    initial_investment = -100000\n    cash_flows = [20000, 30000, 50000, 60000]\n    rate = 0.10\n    tolerance = 1e-6\n    max_iterations = 1000\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    for _ in range(max_iterations):\n        npv = initial_investment + sum(\n            cash_flow / ((1 + rate) ** year)\n            for year, cash_flow in enumerate(cash_flows, start=1)\n        )\n        npv_derivative = sum(\n            -year * cash_flow / ((1 + rate) ** (year + 1))\n            for year, cash_flow in enumerate(cash_flows, start=1)\n        )\n\n        if abs(npv) < tolerance:\n            break\n\n        rate -= npv / npv_derivative\n\n    answer = round(rate * 100, 2)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
